{
  "component": "Page",
  "props": {
    "theme": "coffee",
    "title": "The Coffee Atlas — Learn coffee the slow way",
    "description": "A field guide to specialty coffee for curious home baristas: six chapters from seed to cup, ending with a recipe of your own."
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "component": "SiteHeader",
      "props": {
        "brand": "The Coffee Atlas",
        "tagline": "Field guide & academy",
        "mark": "wordmark",
        "links": [
          {
            "label": "Chapters",
            "href": "#syllabus"
          },
          {
            "label": "Tutors",
            "href": "#letter"
          },
          {
            "label": "Live sessions",
            "href": "/events"
          },
          {
            "label": "Tuition",
            "href": "#pricing"
          },
          {
            "label": "FAQ",
            "href": "#faq"
          }
        ],
        "signIn": {
          "label": "Sign in",
          "href": "/login"
        },
        "cta": {
          "label": "Start the free chapter",
          "href": {
            "$data": "/course/previewHref",
            "$default": "/"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "component": "StatusBar",
      "props": {
        "variant": "ribbon",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": "Self-paced"
          },
          {
            "label": "Long-form"
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "$data": "/course/level",
              "$default": "Beginner"
            }
          },
          {
            "label": "Huila · Kraków"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "component": "Main",
      "children": [
        {
          "component": "Hero",
          "props": {
            "variant": "editorial",
            "eyebrow": "A field guide from seed to cup",
            "title": {
              "$data": "/course/landing/headline",
              "$default": "Learn coffee the slow way."
            },
            "titleAccent": "slow way.",
            "subtitle": {
              "$data": "/course/landing/subheadline",
              "$default": "Six chapters. One cherry. Your best cup."
            },
            "body": {
              "$data": "/course/summary"
            },
            "primaryCta": {
              "label": {
                "$data": "/course/landing/cta",
                "$default": "Start the free chapter"
              },
              "href": {
                "$data": "/course/previewHref",
                "$default": "/"
              }
            },
            "secondaryCta": {
              "label": "See the syllabus →",
              "href": "#syllabus"
            },
            "image": {
              "src": "/landing/coffee/hero-cherries.webp",
              "alt": "Weathered hands cupping freshly picked red coffee cherries in front of coffee shrubs on a misty hillside",
              "width": 1408,
              "height": 768
            },
            "caption": "Ripe cherries at first light, Huila, Colombia.",
            "facts": {
              "$data": "/course/facts"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "component": "Syllabus",
          "props": {
            "variant": "folio",
            "eyebrow": "Course syllabus",
            "title": "The folio & index",
            "intro": "Six chapters, in the order a coffee travels from the farm to your cup. Read at your own pace.",
            "lessons": {
              "$data": "/course/lessons"
            },
            "totalLabel": {
              "$data": "/course/lessonsLabel"
            },
            "cta": {
              "label": "Open the course",
              "href": {
                "$data": "/course/href",
                "$default": "/"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "component": "Letter",
          "props": {
            "eyebrow": "A letter from your tutors",
            "title": "Why coffee asks for our undivided patience.",
            "paragraphs": [
              "We met over a cupping table in Bogotá, arguing about whether a washed Caturra could taste of hibiscus. It could, and we have been comparing notes ever since.",
              "This course is the long version of that afternoon. We follow a single cherry from the hillside to your kitchen, and we stop wherever something interesting happens: at the drying beds, at first crack, at the moment your pour-over turns from sour to sweet."
            ],
            "quote": "Take your time. Read with a cup beside you. By the last chapter you will have a recipe that is entirely your own.",
            "people": [
              {
                "name": "Inés Duarte",
                "role": "Q-grader",
                "place": "Huila, Colombia",
                "image": {
                  "src": "/landing/coffee/ines-duarte.webp",
                  "alt": "Inés Duarte holding a ceramic cup on a coffee farm with drying beds behind her",
                  "width": 1408,
                  "height": 768
                }
              },
              {
                "name": "Tomasz Wierzba",
                "role": "Roaster",
                "place": "Kraków, Poland",
                "image": {
                  "src": "/landing/coffee/tomasz-wierzba.webp",
                  "alt": "Tomasz Wierzba scooping green coffee from a jute sack in his roastery",
                  "width": 1408,
                  "height": 768
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "component": "FormatGrid",
          "props": {
            "eyebrow": "Between the covers",
            "title": "What's inside",
            "intro": "Every chapter mixes formats, so each idea arrives the way it is best learned: watched, heard, handled or tried.",
            "items": [
              {
                "format": "video",
                "tag": "Film",
                "name": "Pour-over masterclass",
                "text": "V60 technique step by step, with chapter markers and a transcript.",
                "foot": "Video"
              },
              {
                "format": "audio",
                "tag": "Podcast",
                "name": "Voices from the farm",
                "text": "A conversation with a producer, recorded among the drying beds.",
                "foot": "Audio"
              },
              {
                "format": "interactive",
                "tag": "Interactive",
                "name": "Anatomy of a cherry",
                "text": "Hotspot diagram: skin, pulp, mucilage, parchment, silver skin and bean.",
                "foot": "H5P"
              },
              {
                "format": "pdf",
                "tag": "Printable",
                "name": "The roaster's logbook",
                "text": "A printable log for charge temperature, first crack and development time.",
                "foot": "Download and print"
              },
              {
                "format": "scorm",
                "tag": "Simulator",
                "name": "Roast simulator",
                "text": "Pick a charge temperature and watch the colour change through first crack.",
                "foot": "SCORM package"
              },
              {
                "format": "tracked",
                "tag": "Tracked",
                "name": "Cupping at home",
                "text": "A guided session with a timer and a scoring form, saved to your progress.",
                "foot": "cmi5 activity"
              },
              {
                "format": "quiz",
                "tag": "Quiz",
                "name": "Tasting check",
                "text": "One question of each type, from the flavour wheel to brew ratios.",
                "foot": "Instant feedback"
              },
              {
                "format": "project",
                "tag": "Project",
                "name": "Your signature recipe",
                "text": "Brew three variations and send a recipe card for feedback.",
                "foot": "Reviewed by your tutors"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "component": "Quotes",
          "props": {
            "variant": "pull",
            "items": {
              "$data": "/course/testimonials"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "component": "Events",
          "props": {
            "variant": "feature",
            "eyebrow": "Live session",
            "items": {
              "$data": "/events"
            },
            "image": {
              "src": "/landing/coffee/cupping-table.webp",
              "alt": "A cupping table seen from above: brass tasting bowls of coffee, spoons, linen napkins and a scoring card",
              "width": 1408,
              "height": 768
            },
            "caption": "Cupping protocol: tasting bowls, spoons and a scoring card."
          }
        },
        {
          "component": "Pricing",
          "props": {
            "eyebrow": "Tuition",
            "title": "Simple pricing",
            "intro": "One payment, no subscription. This demo opens every chapter for free.",
            "plans": {
              "$data": "/plans"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "component": "Faq",
          "props": {
            "eyebrow": "Questions",
            "title": "Before you begin",
            "items": {
              "$data": "/course/faq",
              "$default": [
                {
                  "q": "Do I need special equipment?",
                  "a": "A kettle, a scale and any pour-over dripper are enough."
                },
                {
                  "q": "Can I try it before paying?",
                  "a": "Yes. The first chapter opens with a free film."
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "component": "CtaBand",
          "props": {
            "variant": "newsletter",
            "eyebrow": "Monthly dispatch",
            "title": {
              "$data": "/course/landing/newsletter",
              "$default": "Field notes"
            },
            "text": "One letter a month: a coffee we are drinking, a technique worth trying and a note from the farm.",
            "cta": {
              "label": "Start the free chapter",
              "href": {
                "$data": "/course/previewHref",
                "$default": "/"
              }
            }
          }
        }
